          ASCII string.

     NGM_EIFACE_GET_IFADDRS
          Return the list of link-level addresses associated with the node.

SSHHUUTTDDOOWWNN
     This node shuts down upon receipt of a NGM_SHUTDOWN control message.  The
     associated interface is removed and its name becomes available for reuse
     by future _e_i_f_a_c_e nodes.

     Unlike most other node types, an _e_i_f_a_c_e node does _n_o_t go away when all
     hooks have been disconnected; rather, an explicit NGM_SHUTDOWN control
     message is required.

